      "operatingSystem": "Web",
      "description": "Relume is an AI website builder for marketing websites. Build on a human-made component system behind 2M+ websites, publish and grow your site in Relume, or export to Webflow, Figma and React.",
      "featureList": [
        "AI website builder",
        "AI sitemap and wireframe generation",
