      },
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "https://www.relume.ai/#organization"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://www.relume.ai/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is an AI website builder?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "An AI website builder creates a website for you from a short description, a document or your existing site. Instead of starting from a blank page or a template, you tell it about your business and it produces the sitemap, page layouts and copy. Relume's AI website builder is made for marketing websites. It assembles your site from a library of human-designed components, so the result is responsive, accessible and ready to publish."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does Relume's AI website builder work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Drop in your old website, a doc or a few notes. Relume generates a brief, sitemap, wireframes and a style guide, then assembles your pages from its component library. Review and edit anything you like, then publish on Relume or export to Figma, Webflow or React."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Relume's AI website builder free?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. You can build with Relume for free, with no credit card needed. The free plan includes enough monthly usage to build a full website, plus free hosting on a relume.live subdomain. Paid plans give you more monthly usage and premium AI models, and Launch hosting connects your own domain starting at $14 per site per month when billed yearly."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need Webflow to publish a website built with Relume?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. You can publish directly on Relume, with hosting, SSL and a global edge network included. Connect a custom domain with Launch and your site is live. If you prefer your own tools, you can export the same site to Webflow, Figma or React instead."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is Relume different from AI website builders like Wix, Squarespace or Lovable?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Many AI website builders generate layouts or code from scratch each time. Relume's AI doesn't write raw code. It selects and assembles components our designers built and maintain, the same system behind 2M+ websites started since 2023. That means consistent, polished design without broken layouts, and sites that keep improving as components are refined. You also aren't locked in: export your site to Webflow, Figma or React whenever you want."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are websites built with Relume good for SEO?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Every component is responsive, accessible and SEO and AEO ready by construction, with clean semantic structure. Sites published on Relume give you control over robots.txt, sitemap.xml and JSON-LD structured data, indexing settings for search engines and AI crawlers, 301 redirects and custom code."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Who is Relume's AI website builder for?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Relume is used by 1M+ web designers. Freelancers and agencies use it to turn a client brief into a live site quickly, and small businesses use it to launch a professional marketing website without hiring a developer. Invite clients and teammates into your workspace as editors, with no per-seat charge."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I use my own domain?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Free sites publish to a relume.live subdomain, which is ideal for drafts and client review. Launch hosting connects your custom domain, sets up and renews your SSL certificate automatically, and removes the Relume badge."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I edit my website after the AI builds it?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Everything the AI creates is fully editable, from copy and sections to layout, colours and typography. Relume's AI agents can suggest improvements to strategy, copy and design, but you decide what goes live."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
