</svg></div></div></div><div id="choose-path-export-shot" class="w-embed w-script"><!-- Export product shot, cropped to this card — Figma 2608:74988 / 386:51514.
     The 1160x772 editor artboard scaled to the slot and hung off its left edge
     at SHOT_X -404, SHOT_Y 148, so the crop opens on the canvas. Four
     export-target tiles float above it, rising and falling and shifting with the
     pointer; both movements drop under prefers-reduced-motion.

     Scoped `.cpe` so it cannot collide with the hero's `rph` or the Publish
     card's `cpp`. The placeholder image above this is left in the Designer and
     only made `visibility: hidden` at runtime — delete this element to revert.

     v10: THE MOCK SAT 25 DESIGN UNITS TOO FAR RIGHT. v8 read the design change as
     a uniform scale and left `.pageScaler` at `left: 0`. But scale with
     transform-origin 0 0 grows the box RIGHTWARD only: the frame's left edge
     stayed at x 196.17 and its right edge went to 896, while the design has
     Super Component States at x 171.17 with width 700 (right edge 871.17). So
     the whole mock was pushed right, leaving too much card colour beside it.
     Fixed with `left: -32.2px` on `.pageScaler`. Why 32.2 and not 25: `left` is
     applied to the pre-scale box, and the rendered shift is
     L x boardScale / k = L x SW/AW = L x 900/1160 = L x 0.7759 design units, so
     25 / 0.7759 = 32.2. That ratio is SW/AW, both constants, so the offset is
     breakpoint-independent — measured x = 171.4 at 1440 and 171.2 at 390,
     against the design's 171.17, with width 700 at both.
     The outer crop was never wrong: Publish Hero x -404 w 900 in a 633 slot
     renders at boardLeft -408 / width 909 / 21.7% card colour on the right at
     1440, against the design's 21.6%. Do not touch SX/SW to chase this.

     v9: two fixes.
     (a) THE TILES NEVER OVERLAP THE ARTBOARD. `.tiles` was
     `translate(80px, 36px) scale(k)` — translate before scale, so the 80/36
     offset stayed in fixed px while the artboard top moved with k (SY 148 x k).
     Below ~500px wide the artboard rose past the tiles and the lowest tile cut
     into it (measured -5px at 390, while 1440 cleared by 22). Reordered to
     `scale(k) translate(80px, 36px)` so the offset scales too: clearance is now
     proportional at every width (390 -> +12, 900 -> +25, 1440 -> +23), and the
     drift/parallax already scale because they live on the tiles inside the row.
     (b) THE ARTBOARD STROKE IS OUTER. It was
     `box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border)`; an inset ring on an
     element scaled to 0.43-1.01 lands sub-pixel and reads as a broken edge.
     Now `box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border)` — an outer stroke, and
     --color-border resolves to rgba(27,25,25,.1), i.e. Figma `border/subtle`.

     v8: the mock is scaled up 7.69% so the photograph fills the crop with no
     card colour under the man. Read off the design as a UNIFORM scale, not a
     resize: Page Content went 650x378.271 -> 700x407.371 (both exactly x 700/650)
     while the image:container ratio inside stayed 129.22%, so only
     `.pageScaler`'s transform changes, 1.28889 -> 1.38803 (= 1.28889 x 700/650).
     NOTE: enlarging .pageScaler's width/height instead does NOT work - the cloned
     page is fixed-size DOM, so the box grows and the photo does not move.

     v7: the four floating tiles are VECTOR. They shipped as base64 WebP stretched
     by per-tile percentage crops (.tileFigma img was width 218.75%, left
     -59.38%), which is what made them look soft. Each is now an 80x80 SVG built
     from Figma 386:51514 > Floating export options (2479:35606).

     v6: the placeholder is kept IN FLOW. Below 992px the card is
     `display: flex; flex-flow: wrap` and this wrapper is a `0 1 auto` item with
     no width of its own, so `display: none` on the image collapsed it to 0 wide
     and the shot rendered as a tall empty box on every phone.
     v5: vertical-only float; pointer offset 26 -> 6.
     v4: artboard radius + 1px border/subtle stroke; tile motion read from
     export_tiles.tsx at build time.
     v3: `Asset to Export` layer, outlined headline, palette icon, tab type size.
     v2: placeholder hiding via `closest`, not `parentElement`.

     NOTE: this mount is positioned `absolute; top: 0` by the script, so it does
     NOT respect the wrapper's padding. Below 992 the wrapper carries 48px of
     padding-top for the pixel band, so the site head pins this to `bottom: 0`
     instead — otherwise the shot sits under the band, the floating tiles are
     clipped by it, and 48px of empty card colour is left at the bottom.

     LOADING (2026-10-24, perf): below the fold, so it loads after the page via
     the site head's __rlAfterLoadScript (plain load if the helper is missing). -->
<div data-relume-choose-path-export></div>
<script>(window.__rlAfterLoadScript || function (u) { var s = document.createElement('script'); s.src = u; document.head.appendChild(s); })('https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a86861087653b0c0400884a_export-asset-v10.js');</script></div></div><div id="w-node-d943af8e-973d-628c-9433-94c92935be2b-146b7924" class="choose-path_content-right"><div class="choose-path_content-wrapper"><div class="choose-path_tagline-wrapper"><div class="p-icon-wrapper is-large"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a740194588a56a9d752fa62_icon-logo-exports.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""/></div><div data-wf--tagline--variant="export" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large w-variant-7038674f-a83f-2f41-be0d-9a0d62c8e4d1">Export</div></div></div><h2 class="p-heading-style-h4">サイトを作って、Figma・Webflow・Reactへ</h2><p class="p-text-size-xlarge p-text-color-secondary">1,000以上のレスポンシブコンポーネントからサイト全体を構築し、Figma、Webflow、Reactへそのままエクスポート。Relume Library MCPを使えば、AIツールにも取り込めます。</p><div class="p-button-group"><div STYLE="" aria-hidden="true" id="" class="p-button is-ai"><div class="p-button-text">無料で始める</div><a href="/app/signup" class="p-button-link w-inline-block"></a></div><div STYLE="" aria-hidden="true" id="" class="p-button is-secondary"><div class="p-button-text">Exportを見る</div><a href="/ja/export" class="p-button-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid choose-path_item-list"><div id="w-node-_35247e90-1d65-f53e-401f-26d24dca70df-4dca70df" class="choose-path_item"><div class="choose-path_item-icon-wrapper"><div data-wf--icon-wrapper--icon-size="small" class="p-icon-wrapper"><div class="p-icon">icon-export-webflow</div></div></div><div class="choose-path_item-text-wrapper"><h3 class="p-text-size-large p-text-weight-medium is-cp-feature-title">Webflow</h3><p class="p-text-size-medium p-text-color-tertiary is-cp-feature-text">整理されたClient-Firstクラスで、手直し不要</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_35247e90-1d65-f53e-401f-26d24dca70df-4dca70df" class="choose-path_item"><div class="choose-path_item-icon-wrapper"><div data-wf--icon-wrapper--icon-size="small" class="p-icon-wrapper"><div class="p-icon">icon-export-figma</div></div></div><div class="choose-path_item-text-wrapper"><h3 class="p-text-size-large p-text-weight-medium is-cp-feature-title">Figma</h3><p class="p-text-size-medium p-text-color-tertiary is-cp-feature-text">実際の変数とバリアントを備えた、編集可能なオートレイアウト</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_35247e90-1d65-f53e-401f-26d24dca70df-4dca70df" class="choose-path_item"><div class="choose-path_item-icon-wrapper"><div data-wf--icon-wrapper--icon-size="small" class="p-icon-wrapper"><div class="p-icon">icon-export-react</div></div></div><div class="choose-path_item-text-wrapper"><h3 class="p-text-size-large p-text-weight-medium is-cp-feature-title">React</h3><p class="p-text-size-medium p-text-color-tertiary is-cp-feature-text">Tailwind CSSとshadcn/uiコンポーネントでコーディング</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="p-card_border"></div></div></div><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="p-engine_component"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="base" class="p-section-header"><div class="p-section-header_left-content"><div class="p-section-header_tagline-wrapper"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large">エンジン</div></div></div><div class="p-section-header_title"><h2 class="p-heading-style-h3">200万のウェブサイトを支える<br/>コンポーネントシステム。</h2></div></div><div class="p-section-header_right-content"><p class="p-section-header_text">AIが勝手に作り出すレイアウトはありません。Relumeは人の手で作られたコンポーネントを共通のシステム上で組み立てるため、何かが改善されれば、すべてのサイトが改善されます。作り直しも、手間も不要です。</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid p-engine_grid-list"><div class="w-layout-grid p-engine_row"><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;34b020f4-d1a9-171c-f662-9177b63bb5cf&quot;,&quot;34b020f4-d1a9-171c-f662-9177b63bb5cf&quot;],[&quot;d943af8e-973d-628c-9433-94c92935bfd1&quot;]]]" data-wf-component-id="34b020f4-d1a9-171c-f662-9177b63bb5cf" data