</svg></div></div></div><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jordanphughes/" target="_blank" class="p-testimonial_handle w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a83a9bcdfda9c9b17fb162c_Image.png" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Jordan Hughes" class="p-testimonial_handle-avatar"/><div class="p-testimonial_handle-name">@jordanphughes</div></a></div><div id="w-node-d943af8e-973d-628c-9433-94c92935bfb4-146b7924" class="p-testimonial_content-right"><div><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large">トップエージェンシーが選ぶRelume</div></div></div><div><h3 class="p-heading-style-h5 is-p-testimonial-quote">このライブラリの規模、品質、そして自由度は圧倒的です。すべてが連携して動くので、自信を持って洗練されたウェブサイトを立ち上げられます。クライアントのアイデアを実際の画面に落とし込む方法として、これまでで最速。おかげで本当に楽しい部分に時間を使えるようになりました。</h3></div><div class="p-testimonial_client"><div class="p-testimonial_client-info"><div class="p-text-size-large is-p-testimonial-name">Jordan Hughes</div><div class="p-text-size-small p-text-color-tertiary"><a href="https://www.untitledui.com/" target="_blank">Untitled UI 共同創業者</a></div></div><div class="divider-vertical is-p-testimonial"></div><div class="p-testimonial_logo-wrapper"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a83aa023c49633f6e7d5bdb_Logo.svg" class="p-testimonial_logo is-logo-light"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a83d6cef646a44312a9cf06_Logo-untitled-ui-dark.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Untitled UI" class="p-testimonial_logo is-logo-dark"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="p-section_engine"><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="container-large"></div></div></section><section id="community-voting" class="p-section_voting"><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="container-large"></div></div><div id="card-hover-styles" class="w-embed"><!-- Card hover. SHIPPING: background + pixel-pattern recolour ONLY. Verified in light and dark on every card.

     THE HOVER SPACING / CROP IS NOT IMPLEMENTED, and must not be attempted again from
     page CSS. Nine mechanisms were tried against the live page and every one failed.
     This comment is the handover; read it before touching anything.

     SPEC: extra space on the side of the CONTENT that the ASSET sits on. TEXT DOES NOT
     MOVE. Content and pixel pattern move as ONE GROUP with no gap between them. The
     ASSET IS FIXED and is cropped by that amount. The card's outer size never changes.
     Ref: NOVA Design System > Website Card, 9853:19340 (Hover=False) vs 9853:19381
     (Hover=True). Delta 8px; card 572x224 in both states.

     WHY PAGE CSS CANNOT DO THIS. The pixel pattern is position:absolute INSIDE THE
     ASSET WRAPPER, but it belongs to the CONTENT side visually. So any rule has to keep
     two elements in different subtrees glued together while one of them crops the thing
     the other lives inside. Every attempt broke on that:

       1. padding on content            -> REPLACED the base padding (32 -> 8, not 32 -> 40);
                                           base differs per breakpoint (2rem / 1.5rem).
       2. margin on content, far side   -> GREW the card.
       3. negative margin on the ASSET  -> moved the asset; on a grid child it went WIDER
                                           (631 -> 637) -> 3px of card height.
       4. content moved, pattern not    -> CROPPED the pattern.
       5. margin (content) + transform (pattern) -> desynced -> visible gap.
       6. transform on both             -> in sync, but translated the text so the space
                                           landed on the WRONG side.
       7. negative content margin + pattern margin -> cancelled out on the voting card,
                                           whose asset wrapper holds the .rvc shot with
                                           aspect-ratio 631/358 and so resizes from
                                           content-driven margins. Same CSS, opposite
                                           result to the collaboration card.
       8. position:relative on the overlay -> BROKE EVERY CARD ON THE PAGE. It is already
                                           absolute; forcing relative put it in normal
                                           flow, giving 1344px-tall cards against a
                                           correct 652px, overflowing assets, one blank.
       9. transform on both, vertical only -> measured in sync at 90ms and at rest, but
                                           STILL SHOWS A GAP: moving the pattern up
                                           vacates the strip it occupied and the asset
                                           shows through it. Synchronised motion does not
                                           fix that; only the content's painted area
                                           extending to fill the strip does, and that is
                                           a layout change, which is failure 2 or 3.

     Failures 5, 6 and 9 are the same trap seen three ways: the pattern cannot be moved
     from outside without leaving a hole behind it.

     THE ACTUAL FIX, in the component:
       - move the pixel overlay OUT of the asset wrapper and INTO the content subtree, so
         "content + pattern move together" is ONE element moving and there is no strip to
         vacate and no second element to keep in step;
       - give the asset cell a size that does not depend on the content (a fixed track in
         grid-template-columns, or decouple the shot's fit from aspect-ratio), so the
         asset is genuinely stationary on both horizontal cards;
       - then the hover is one rule on one element.

     Bind to Publish - Spacing 'default' (8px). Figma md = 8px but Webflow md = 16px;
     Figma xs = 4px but Webflow xs = 6px — map by VALUE, never by name.

     VERIFY: absolute card dimensions against a baseline (not rest-vs-hover deltas, which
     passed while cards were 1344px tall), the asset's own rect unchanged, mid-flight
     sampling at ~90ms, AND a screenshot of the boundary between content and pattern —
     failure 9 passed every numeric check and was still visibly wrong. -->
<style>
  .p-vote_component .p-pixel-block,
  .icon-tagline_card .p-pixel-block { transition: background .2s ease; }
  .p-vote_component:hover .p-pixel-block { background: var(--_publish-colors---background--secondary); }
  .p-vote_component:hover .p-pixel-block.is-transparent { background: var(--_publish-primitives---colors--transparent); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .p-vote_component .p-pixel-block,
    .icon-tagline_card .p-pixel-block { transition: none; }
  }
</style></div></section><section class="p-section_showcase"><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="p-showcase_component"><div data-wf--section-header--variant="base" class="p-section-header"><div class="p-section-header_left-content"><div class="p-section-header_tagline-wrapper"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large">デモプロジェクト</div></div></div><div class="p-section-header_title"><h2 class="p-heading-style-h3">クリックで試したい方へ。<br/>デモプロジェクトを開いてみましょう。</h2></div></div><div class="p-section-header_right-content"><p class="p-section-header_text">出力の感触をつかむ一番の近道は、実際に中を触ってみること。用意されたプロジェクトを開いて、自由に探索してください。</p></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid p-showcase_grid-list"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq"><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="home-faq_header"><h2 class="home-faq_title">AIウェブサイトビルダーに関するよくある質問</h2></div><div class="home-faq_list"><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">AIウェブサイトビルダーとは？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">AIウェブサイトビルダーは、簡単な説明やドキュメント、既存のサイトをもとにウェブサイトを作成するツールです。白紙やテンプレートから始めるのではなく、ビジネスについて伝えるだけで、サイトマップ、ページレイアウト、コピーを生成します。RelumeのAIウェブサイトビルダーはマーケティングサイト向けに作られています。人の手でデザインされたコンポーネントのライブラリからサイトを組み立てるため、レスポンシブでアクセシブル、すぐに公開できる仕上がりになります。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">RelumeのAIウェブサイトビルダーはどのように機能しますか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">古いウェブサイト、ドキュメント、ちょっとしたメモを入れるだけ。Relumeがブリーフ、サイトマップ、ワイヤーフレーム、スタイルガイドを生成し、コンポーネントライブラリからページを組み立てます。内容は自由に確認・編集でき、Relumeで公開するか、Figma、Webflow、Reactへエクスポートできます。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">RelumeのAIウェブサイトビルダーは無料ですか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">はい。クレジットカード不要で、無料でRelumeを使って構築できます。無料プランには、ウェブサイト1つを丸ごと構築できる月間利用枠と、relume.liveサブドメインでの無料ホスティングが含まれます。有料プランでは月間利用枠が増え、プレミアムAIモデルを利用できます。Launchホスティングなら、1サイトあたり月額$12から独自ドメインを接続できます。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">Relumeで作ったウェブサイトを公開するのにWebflowは必要ですか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">いいえ。Relumeから直接公開でき、ホスティング、SSL、グローバルエッジネットワークが含まれています。Launchでカスタムドメインを接続すれば、サイトはすぐに公開されます。使い慣れたツールを使いたい場合は、同じサイトをWebflow、Figma、Reactへエクスポートすることもできます。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">RelumeはWix、Squarespace、LovableといったAIウェブサイトビルダーと何が違いますか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">多くのAIウェブサイトビルダーは、毎回ゼロからレイアウトやコードを生成します。RelumeのAIは生のコードを書きません。当社のデザイナーが構築・保守しているコンポーネントを選んで組み立てます。これは2023年以降に作られた200万以上のウェブサイトを支えるのと同じシステムです。そのため、レイアウトが崩れることなく一貫した洗練されたデザインを実現でき、コンポーネントが改良されるたびにサイトも改善され続けます。ロックインもありません。いつでもWebflow、Figma、Reactへサイトをエクスポートできます。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">Relumeで作ったウェブサイトはSEOに強いですか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">はい。すべてのコンポーネントは設計段階からレスポンシブかつアクセシブルで、SEO・AEOに対応し、クリーンなセマンティック構造を備えています。Relumeで公開したサイトでは、robots.txt、sitemap.xml、JSON-LD構造化データ、検索エンジンやAIクローラー向けのインデックス設定、301リダイレクト、カスタムコードを管理できます。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">RelumeのAIウェブサイトビルダーは誰向けですか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">Relumeは100万人以上のウェブデザイナーに利用されています。フリーランスや制作会社はクライアントのブリーフを素早く公開サイトに仕上げるために、中小企業は開発者を雇わずにプロフェッショナルなマーケティングサイトを立ち上げるために活用しています。クライアントやチームメンバーを編集者としてワークスペースに招待でき、シートごとの料金はかかりません。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">独自ドメインは使えますか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">はい。無料サイトはrelume.liveサブドメインで公開され、下書きやクライアントレビューに最適です。Launchホスティングでは、カスタムドメインの接続、SSL証明書の自動設定と更新、Relumeバッジの非表示が可能です。</p></div></details><details class="home-faq_item home-faq_item"><summary class="home-faq_question home-faq_question"><h3 class="home-faq_heading">AIが作ったウェブサイトを後から編集できますか？</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="home-faq_icon">+</span></summary><div class="home-faq_answer"><p class="home-faq_text">はい。AIが作成したものはすべて、コピーやセクションからレイアウト、カラー、タイポグラフィまで自由に編集できます。RelumeのAIエージェントは戦略、コピー、デザインの改善を提案しますが、何を公開するかはあなたが決めます。</p></div></details></div></div></div></div></section><section class="p-section_final-cta text-color-white"><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
/* Final CTA snake layer. Engine + runtime now load once, from the hero cube
   embed at the top of the page - the runtime boots every [data-relume-anim]
   host on the page, so this block only needs its own config.
   The layer extends 80px past the section top and bottom and clips THERE.
   Why not overflow:visible on the layer: .p-page-wrapper is overflow-x:clip, and
   per CSS when one axis is clip the other computes to auto — so the 1600px host
   spilling downward grew the page's scroll area and added dead space under the
   footer. Clipping to a fixed ±80px bleed window keeps the overspill visible
   without letting the empty host area affect page height.
   Host is 140% wide because the group is WIDTH-bound at 100% (1128x372 max);
   widening it lets the artwork scale to 1438x524 and reach past the section.
   pointer-events:none keeps the composer and every footer link clickable. */
.p-section_final-cta{z-index:2;}
.p-final-cta_snake-layer{position:absolute;top:-80px;bottom:-80px;left:0;right:0;
z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden;}
.p-final-cta_snake-host{position:absolute;left:50%;width:140%;margin-left:-70%;
top:50%;height:1600px;transform:translateY(-50%);overflow:visible;}
[data-relume-anim="fc-snake"]{background:transparent !important;}
@media screen and (max-width:479px){.p-final-cta_snake-layer{display:none;}}
</style>
<div class="p-final-cta_snake-layer" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="p-final-cta_snake-host" data-relume-anim="fc-snake">
    <div data-relume-stage style="position:absolute;inset:0;"></div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
var still = window.matchMedia &&
window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
var c = {"style":"solid","shape":"snake","gridSize":12,"viewScale":0.6,
"animation":"spin","text":"A","snakeCount":4,"snakeLen":40,
"snakeHSpacing":150,"snakeVSpacing":0,
"cubeScheme":"primary","speed":0.08,"axisMix":0,"tilt":32,
"buildStart":0,"buildEase":"place","buildDrop":3,"buildBounce":0.2,
"floatAmount":0.5,"floatRotate":true,"scrollDriven":false,
"hoverOn":false,"hoverRadius":1,"hoverStyle":"trail",
"lightOn":true,"lightStrength":0.2,
"faceColor":"#ffb02e","secondaryColor":"#aeffff",
"strokeColor":"#1b1919","strokeWidth":1};
if (still) { c.speed = 0; c.floatAmount = 0; c.floatRotate = false; }
window.__RELUME_CFG__ = window.__RELUME_CFG__ || {};
window.__RELUME_CFG__['fc-snake'] = c;
})();
</script></div><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small"><div class="p-final-cta_component"><div class="p-max-width-xlarge"><div class="margin-bottom margin-tiny"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large p-tagline-xlarge">Getting Started</div></div></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h1 class="p-heading-style-h1">Build a marketing site you’d actually publish</h1></div><p class="text-size-medium">Launch something you&#x27;re proud of. Watch it get better every month.</p><div data-relume-intake="root" class="p-composer_wrapper"><div class="p-composer_form_component w-form"><form id="email-form" name="email-form" data-name="Email Form" method="get" class="p-composer_form" data-wf-page-id="6a7e0020ee3a9a26146b7924" data-wf-element-id="c9cdaf10-c334-ed0b-d8e1-361f97a77951" data-wf-locale-id="67d12cda4f07027b560022d9"><textarea data-relume-intake="prompt" class="p-composer_form-input w-input" maxlength="5000" name="brief" data-name="brief" placeholder="Describe your business..." id="brief"></textarea><div class="p-composer_attachments"><div data-relume-intake="chips" class="p-composer_attachments-list"><div data-relume-intake="chip" class="p-composer_attachment"><div class="p-composer_attachment-inner"><div class="p-composer_attachment-preview"><div class="p-composer_attachment-glyph"></div></div><div data-relume-intake="chip-name" class="p-composer_attachment-name">Filename.pdf</div><div data-relume-intake="chip-remove" class="p-composer_attachment-remove">×</div></div></div></div></div><div class="p-composer_actions"><div data-relume-intake="attach" class="p-intake-hook"><div STYLE="" aria-hidden="true" id="" class="p-button is-icon-only is-secondary"><div class="p-icon-only"><div data-wf--icon-wrapper--icon-size="small" class="p-icon-wrapper"><div class="p-icon">icon-attachment</div></div></div><a href="#" class="p-button-link w-inline-block"></a></div></div><div class="p-composer_right-actions"><div data-composer-products="" role="tablist" class="p-composer_switch"><div data-composer-product="publish" aria-label="Relume Publish" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" role="tab" class="p-composer_switch-tab is-active"><div class="p-composer_switch-icon is-publish"></div><div class="p-composer_switch-label">Publish</div></div><div data-composer-product="export" aria-label="Relume Export" aria-selected="false" tabindex="0" role="tab" class="p-composer_switch-tab"><div class="p-composer_switch-icon is-export"></div><div class="p-composer_switch-label">Export</div><div class="p-composer_switch-targets"><div class="p-composer_switch-target is-webflow"></div><div class="p-composer_switch-target is-figma"></div><div class="p-composer_switch-target is-react"></div></div></div></div><div data-relume-intake="submit" class="p-intake-hook"><button STYLE="" aria-hidden="true" id="" class="p-button is-ai"><div class="p-button-text">Generate Website</div></button></div></div></div><div data-relume-intake="error" class="p-composer_error"></div></form><div class="p-text-size-medium p-text-color-tertiary"><a href="#" class="p-text-style-link p-text-color-secondary">Try an example</a></div><div class="form_message-success-wrapper w-form-done"><div class="form_message-success"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div></div><div class="form_message-error-wrapper w-form-fail"><div class="form_message-error"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><div class="p-footer"><footer class="p-footer_component"><div class="p-padding-global"><div class="p-footer_container"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="w-layout-grid p-footer_top-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid p-footer_menu-wrapper"><div class="p-footer_link-list"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large p-tagline-small">Product</div></div><a href="/ja/publish" class="p-footer_link has-badge w-inline-block"><div>Relume Publish</div><div class="p-footer_badge-new"><div class="p-text-size-small p-text-weight-medium">New</div></div></a><a href="/ja/export" class="p-footer_link">Relume Export</a><a href="/ja/components" class="p-footer_link">Relume Library</a><a href="/ja/react/components" class="p-footer_link">React Library</a><a href="/ja/library-mcp" class="p-footer_link">Library MCP</a><a href="/ja/mcp" class="p-footer_link">Relume MCP</a><a href="/claude-design-export" class="p-footer_link">Claude Design Export</a><a href="/ja/style-guide" class="p-footer_link">Style Guide</a><a href="/ja/figma-library" class="p-footer_link">Figma Kit</a><a href="/ja/chrome-extension" class="p-footer_link">Chrome Extension</a></div><div class="p-footer_link-list"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large p-tagline-small">Community</div></div><a href="/ja/community-love" class="p-footer_link">Community Love</a><a href="/ja/component-voting" class="p-footer_link">Component Voting</a><a href="/ja/showcase" class="p-footer_link">Showcase</a><a href="/ja/inspiration" class="p-footer_link">Inspiration Feed</a><a href="https://community.relume.io" target="_blank" class="p-footer_link">Slack Community</a><a href="https://contra.com/relume" target="_blank" class="p-footer_link">Hire an Expert</a><a href="/ja/affiliates" class="p-footer_link">Become an Affiliate</a></div><div class="p-footer_link-list"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div class="p-tagline-large p-tagline-small">Company</div></div><a href="/ja/pricing" class="p-footer_link">Pricing</a><a href="/ja/whats-new" class="p-footer_link">What&#x27;s New</a><a href="/ja/contact-sales" class="p-footer_link">Contact Sales</a><a href="mailto:careers@relume.io" class="p-footer_link">Careers</a></div><div class="p-footer_link-list"><div data-wf--tagline--variant="accent" class="p-tagline"><div cla