und the globe.</div></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid p-footer_social-list"><a href="https://slack.relume.ai/" target="_blank" class="p-footer_social-link w-inline-block"><div class="p-icon-wrapper is-medium"><div class="social-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
