     from this component: initHoverCards binds .p-footer_member-photo and builds
     one shared #ra-hovercard. Loading the engine here makes the cards travel
     with the footer, so any page using it gets them.

     BOTH halves are required. The JS builds the card; every rule that makes it
     a card (.ra-hc__*, [data-anim="hovercard"], blur-fade) lives in
     relume-anim-v25.css, which the boot script injects. Loading the JS alone
     produces a fully populated card with NO styles - position:static, width:0,
     parked off-screen. It looks like the hover is dead; it is not.

     CSS goes in at parse time so there is no unstyled flash, guarded by href.
     The JS check waits for DOMContentLoaded: Webflow injects page-level footer
     scripts at the very end of body, after this component, so a parse-time
     check misses them and loads a second copy. -->
<style data-footer-social-wrap>
/* The social row is the site's only source of horizontal scroll on a phone.
   It is a nowrap row of 8 links (44px each) with 7 dividers and 12px gaps =
   527px, inside a 338px column on a 375px screen. The document then scrolls
   546px wide - on every page carrying this footer, the post pages included.

   Below 600px it becomes two tidy rows of four. The dividers are hidden there
   rather than left to fall at a row break, and the 44px tap target is kept.
   Above 600px the single designed row fits and is untouched.

   grid-auto-flow MUST be reset to row. The element is a Webflow w-layout-grid
   with grid-auto-flow:column, which ignores the four explicit columns and keeps
   adding implicit ones - eight tracks on one line, still overflowing. */
@media (max-width:600px){
  .p-footer_social-list{
    display:grid;
    grid-auto-flow:row;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,44px);
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .p-footer_social-divider{display:none}
}
</style>
<script data-footer-fx-loader>
(function(){
  var CSS = 'https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a841378d850c8af43217a52_relume-anim-v25.css';
  var JS  = 'https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/6a829c938410bb2eb32355fb_relume-anim-v28.js';
  if (!document.querySelector('link[href*="relume-anim-v"][rel="stylesheet"]')) {
    var l = document.createElement('link');
    l.rel = 'stylesheet'; l.href = CSS;
    (document.head || document.documentElement).appendChild(l);
  }
  function loadJs(){
    if (window.__relumeAnimLoading) return;
    if (document.querySelector('script[src*="relume-anim-v"]')) return;
    window.__relumeAnimLoading = true;
    var s = document.createElement('script');
    s.src = JS;
    s.integrity = 'sha384-Y26FdlE7MCFNKm+pHIyD8bz+Cpii49L6DmFIGNXKnvdoHHRV9E2RBQ5R/OtYfw9v';
    s.crossOrigin = 'anonymous';
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', loadJs);
  else loadJs();
})();
</script></div><div class="cookies"><div fs-cc="banner" class="fs-cc-banner_component"><div class="fs-cc-banner_wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-banner_text">[Cookieを受け入れる] をクリックすると、サイトのナビゲーションを強化し、サイトの使用状況を分析し、当社のマーケティング活動を支援するために、デバイスにCookieを保存することに同意したものとみなされます。詳細については、当社のクッキーポリシーをご覧ください。</div><div fs-cc="close" class="fs-cc-banner_close"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/62145d6ec4b91db3f5e5f756_close-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="fs-cc-banner_buttons-wrapper"><a fs-cc="open-preferences" id="w-node-_026c7a93-a3d5-dfa1-6d38-d0da94423970-94423962" href="#" class="fs-cc-banner_text-link button-text-link">クッキー設定</a><a fs-cc="allow" href="#" class="fs-cc-banner_button w-button">クッキーを受け入れる</a></div></div><div fs-cc="interaction" class="fs-cc-banner_trigger"></div></div><div fs-cc-scroll="disable" fs-cc="preferences" class="fs-cc-prefs_component w-form"><form id="cookie-preferences" name="wf-form-Cookie-Preferences" data-name="Cookie Preferences" method="get" class="fs-cc-prefs_form" data-wf-page-id="6a7e0020ee3a9a26146b7924" data-wf-element-id="026c7a93-a3d5-dfa1-6d38-d0da94423976" data-wf-locale-id="67d12cda4f07027b560022d9"><div fs-cc="close" class="fs-cc-prefs_close"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6177739448baa66404ce1d9c/617b4c2d98190845b6254297_close-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="modal-close-icon"/></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_content"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_title-wrapper"><div class="heading-medium">クッキー設定</div></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_modal-wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_space-small"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_text">Relume Libraryは、お客様により良い体験を提供するためにクッキーを使用しています。を参照してください。 <a href="/ja/legal/cookie-policy" class="text-style-link">クッキーポリシー</a> 詳細については。</div></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_button-wrapper"><a fs-cc="deny" href="#" class="fs-cc-prefs_button fs-cc-button-alt w-button">すべてのクッキーを拒否</a><a fs-cc="allow" href="#" class="fs-cc-prefs_button w-button">すべてのクッキーを許可する</a></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_space-xsmall"><div class="heading-small">プリファレンスを管理</div></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_option"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle-wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_label">必須</div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_text">サイトが機能するために不可欠です。常時オン。<br/></div></div><div class="filter-button is-active clickable-off"><div class="filter-toggle-circle"></div></div></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_option"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle-wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_label">パーソナライゼーション</div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_text">プリファレンスの選択を記憶し、拡張機能を提供するために使用されます。<br/></div></div><label class="w-checkbox fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" id="personalization-2" name="personalization-2" data-name="Personalization 2" fs-cc-checkbox="personalization" class="w-checkbox-input fs-cc-prefs_checkbox"/><span for="personalization-2" class="fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-label w-form-label">必須</span><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle"></div></label></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_option"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle-wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_label">マーケティング</div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_text">ターゲットを絞った広告に使用されます。<br/></div></div><label class="w-checkbox fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" id="marketing-3" name="marketing-3" data-name="Marketing 3" fs-cc-checkbox="marketing" class="w-checkbox-input fs-cc-prefs_checkbox"/><span for="marketing-3" class="fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-label w-form-label">必須</span><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle"></div></label></div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_option last"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle-wrapper"><div class="fs-cc-prefs_label">分析</div><div class="fs-cc-prefs_text">使用状況を測定し、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるために使用されます。<br/></div></div><label class="w-checkbox fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" id="analytics-2" name="analytics-2" data-name="Analytics 2" fs-cc-checkbox="analytics" class="w-checkbox-input fs-cc-prefs_checkbox"/><span for="analytics-2" class="fs-cc-prefs_checkbox-label w-form-label">必須</span><div class="fs-cc-prefs_toggle"></div></label>