.p-vote_component a,.p-vote_component button,
.p-agents_tabs a,.p-agents_tabs button,
.p-agents_tab-link{cursor:pointer!important}
</style></div><div id="plan-card-shot" class="w-embed w-script"><!-- Coded Plan product shot. Replaces the flat card-plan SVG in the first column of brief-design_row with real DOM, so it switches with dark mode and stays crisp at any width. The script hides that image (display:none, not deleted) and mounts in its place; if the markup ever moves it does nothing and the SVG stays. Source: nova/frontend/base/marketing/plan_asset
